    <bpmn:process id="W_W5217" name="W5217. Conditional Progress Waiver of Lien Issuance (upon Delivery)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Material goods delivery receipt verification (W5209); billing invoice release
Frequency: Continuous per invoice billing batch
Volume: ~1,500–2,000 conditional waivers generated monthly (the ~100–120/month are the unconditional settlement counterparts per W5218)
Owner: Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist
Participants: Developer Attorney, General Contractor
Source: workflow W5217 — Conditional Progress Waiver of Lien Issuance (upon Delivery)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5217_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5217_Lane1" name="Project Billing Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5217_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5217_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5217_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5217_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5217_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5217_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5217_Start3" name="Material goods delivery receipt verification (W5209); billing invoice release">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5217_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5217_Task4" name="Retrieve matching project code, invoice number, and delivery receipt…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Retrieve matching project code, invoice number, and delivery receipt weights/details.
Responsible (R): Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist
Accountable (A): Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist
Duration: 2-3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5217_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5217_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5217_Task5" name="Draft the Conditional Progress Waiver of Lien (specifying that BuildRight…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Draft the Conditional Progress Waiver of Lien (specifying that BuildRight waives lien rights on delivered materials conditional upon actual payment clearance).
Responsible (R): Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist
Accountable (A): Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist
Duration: 2-3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5217_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5217_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5217_Task6" name="File and print copy of the conditional waiver; attach to the Escrow Draw…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: File and print copy of the conditional waiver; attach to the Escrow Draw Request folder (W5211).
Responsible (R): Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist
Accountable (A): Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist
Duration: 2-3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5217_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5217_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5217_Task7" name="Record waiver status as &#x27;Conditional-Pending Payment&#x27; in ERP project registry.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Record waiver status as &#x27;Conditional-Pending Payment&#x27; in ERP project registry.
Responsible (R): Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist
Accountable (A): Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist
Duration: 2-3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5217_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5217_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5217_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5217_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5217_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-775 (ensure controlled execution — Waiver of Lien, Progress Billing Reconciliation &amp; Account Hold Management (PA-181.3).) | - CTL-775: Document template legal-locked; waiver output verified by AR supervisor.
Owner: Project Billing Clerk / AR Specialist</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
