    <bpmn:process id="W_W5218" name="W5218. Unconditional Progress Waiver of Lien Issuance (upon Fund Settlement)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Escrow draw fund settlement matching (W5213)
Frequency: Continuous per payment clearance
Volume: ~100–120 waivers monthly
Owner: AR Supervisor / Credit Officer
Participants: Developer Attorney, Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W5218 — Unconditional Progress Waiver of Lien Issuance (upon Fund Settlement)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5218_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5218_Lane1" name="AR Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5218_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5218_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5218_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5218_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5218_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5218_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5218_Start3" name="Escrow draw fund settlement matching (W5213)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5218_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5218_Task4" name="Verify payment clearance: check cash application status in ERP showing invoices…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Verify payment clearance: check cash application status in ERP showing invoices cleared (W5213).
Responsible (R): AR Supervisor / Credit Officer
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor / Credit Officer
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5218_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5218_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5218_Task5" name="Draft Unconditional Progress Waiver of Lien referencing the cleared invoice…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Draft Unconditional Progress Waiver of Lien referencing the cleared invoice IDs, payment references, and values.
Responsible (R): AR Supervisor / Credit Officer
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor / Credit Officer
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5218_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5218_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5218_Task6" name="Secure signature from the B2B Credit Manager or Legal Counsel.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Secure signature from the B2B Credit Manager or Legal Counsel.
Responsible (R): AR Supervisor / Credit Officer
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor / Credit Officer
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5218_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5218_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5218_Task7" name="Send original notarized Unconditional Waiver of Lien to the developer; update…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Send original notarized Unconditional Waiver of Lien to the developer; update status as &#x27;Settled-Unconditional&#x27; in ERP.
Responsible (R): AR Supervisor / Credit Officer
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor / Credit Officer
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5218_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5218_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5218_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5218_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5218_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-775 (ensure controlled execution — Waiver of Lien, Progress Billing Reconciliation &amp; Account Hold Management (PA-181.3).) | - CTL-775: Notarized waiver copies kept in legal archives; sign-off authorized only upon cleared cash validation.
Owner: AR Supervisor / Credit Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
