    <bpmn:process id="W_W5220" name="W5220. Project Escrow Delay Credit-Hold Hold-and-Release Execution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Bank draw delay exceeding credit terms (VS-16); developer account delinquent
Frequency: Event-driven per delinquency
Volume: ~5–10 holds executed monthly
Owner: B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP
Participants: Category Buyer, Site Engineer, Store Managers, WMS dispatch (VS-04)
Source: workflow W5220 — Project Escrow Delay Credit-Hold Hold-and-Release Execution</bpmn:documentation>
