      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5220_Start3" name="Bank draw delay exceeding credit terms (VS-16); developer account delinquent">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5220_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5220_Task4" name="Identify delinquent project accounts: check ERP aging reports for payments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify delinquent project accounts: check ERP aging reports for payments delayed past escrow terms (e.g. over 60 days).
Responsible (R): B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP
Accountable (A): B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5220_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5220_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5220_Task5" name="Issue formal payment warning: send credit hold notice to the developer and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Issue formal payment warning: send credit hold notice to the developer and general contractor.
Responsible (R): B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP
Accountable (A): B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5220_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5220_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5220_Task6" name="Execute ERP Credit Hold: lock the project code in ERP to prevent shipping…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute ERP Credit Hold: lock the project code in ERP to prevent shipping orders or releasing reserved stocks.
Responsible (R): B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP
Accountable (A): B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5220_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5220_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5220_Task7" name="Negotiate payment release or release hold manually in ERP upon receiving bank…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Negotiate payment release or release hold manually in ERP upon receiving bank verification of pending transfer.
Responsible (R): B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP
Accountable (A): B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5220_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5220_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5220_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5220_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5220_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-775 (ensure controlled execution — Waiver of Lien, Progress Billing Reconciliation &amp; Account Hold Management (PA-181.3).) | - CTL-775: Hold overrides require CFO or B2B VP approval; audit logs of credit overrides reviewed monthly.
Owner: B2B Credit Manager / B2B VP</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
