Volume: ~10–15 tripartite agreements annually
Owner: Legal &amp; Compliance Counsel / Credit Manager
Participants: Developer, Subcontractor, Legal (VS-100), AR Specialist
Source: workflow W5221 — Developer-Subcontractor Tripartite Payment Agreement Governance</bpmn:documentation>
