        <bpmn:outgoing>W5222_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5222_Task5" name="Apply system reservation lock in WMS: tag inventory as &#x27;Project-Restricted -…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Apply system reservation lock in WMS: tag inventory as &#x27;Project-Restricted - Mapped to Developer Code X&#x27;.
Responsible (R): DC Warehouse Manager (VS-04) / Supply Planner (VS-02)
Accountable (A): DC Warehouse Manager (VS-04) / Supply Planner (VS-02)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
