        <bpmn:outgoing>W5222_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5222_Task6" name="Configure WMS restriction rules: prevent stock from being picked for retail…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Configure WMS restriction rules: prevent stock from being picked for retail stores or standard B2C sales.
Responsible (R): DC Warehouse Manager (VS-04) / Supply Planner (VS-02)
Accountable (A): DC Warehouse Manager (VS-04) / Supply Planner (VS-02)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5222_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5222_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5222_Task7" name="Release inventory lock: auto-release stock upon receiving matched project…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Release inventory lock: auto-release stock upon receiving matched project delivery dispatch manifest (VS-60).
Responsible (R): DC Warehouse Manager (VS-04) / Supply Planner (VS-02)
Accountable (A): DC Warehouse Manager (VS-04) / Supply Planner (VS-02)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5222_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5222_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
