    <bpmn:process id="W_W5223" name="W5223. Progressive Billing Audit, Revenue Leakage Prevention &amp; Internal Control Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly internal control audit cycle (VS-21.3); major project close-out
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: ~20–30 audits annually
Owner: Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Revenue Assurance Lead (VS-118)
Participants: Credit Manager, Project Accountant, Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W5223 — Progressive Billing Audit, Revenue Leakage Prevention &amp; Internal Control Review</bpmn:documentation>
