      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5223_Task4" name="Extract transaction histories for active project accounts: compare total…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Extract transaction histories for active project accounts: compare total invoiced values against JQS worksheets and bank escrow releases.
Responsible (R): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Revenue Assurance Lead (VS-118)
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Revenue Assurance Lead (VS-118)
Duration: 0.5-1 day (incl. bank/escrow response waits)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5223_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5223_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5223_Task5" name="Identify leakage points: verify unmatched invoices, unpaid retainage balances…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Identify leakage points: verify unmatched invoices, unpaid retainage balances, un-notarized lien waivers, and unauthorized credit overrides.
Responsible (R): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Revenue Assurance Lead (VS-118)
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Revenue Assurance Lead (VS-118)
Duration: 0.5-1 day (incl. bank/escrow response waits)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5223_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5223_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5223_Task6" name="Draft the Revenue Leakage Audit Report: highlight billing errors, tax…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Draft the Revenue Leakage Audit Report: highlight billing errors, tax compliance gaps (VAT mismatch), and control vulnerabilities.
Responsible (R): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Revenue Assurance Lead (VS-118)
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Revenue Assurance Lead (VS-118)
Duration: 0.5-1 day (incl. bank/escrow response waits)</bpmn:documentation>
