        <bpmn:outgoing>W5223_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5223_Task7" name="Execute remediation: adjust billing entries, file for delayed tax clearances…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Execute remediation: adjust billing entries, file for delayed tax clearances, and implement new validation locks.
Responsible (R): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Revenue Assurance Lead (VS-118)
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Revenue Assurance Lead (VS-118)
Duration: 0.5-1 day (incl. bank/escrow response waits)</bpmn:documentation>
