    <bpmn:process id="W_W5224" name="W5224. Project Account Financial Close, Final Waiver of Lien &amp; Release of Escrow" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Practical completion certificate issued; construction project final phase complete
Frequency: Event-driven per project close
Volume: ~65–100 project closes annually (the B2B register canon)
Owner: B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Participants: Developer Finance Director, Bank Escrow Agent, CFO, B2B Controller
Source: workflow W5224 — Project Account Financial Close, Final Waiver of Lien &amp; Release of Escrow</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5224_LaneSet2">
