        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-775 (ensure controlled execution — Waiver of Lien, Progress Billing Reconciliation &amp; Account Hold Management (PA-181.3).) | - CTL-775: Project account audited and closed by Corporate Controller; signed final releases filed in corporate archives (VS-88).
Owner: B2B Accounts Receivable Supervisor / Legal Operations (VS-100)</bpmn:text>
